{
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "nats-01",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "MaxMsgs、MaxBytes 和 MaxAge 在 WorkQueuePolicy 与 InterestPolicy 中仍作为保留上限；文档明确 age、size 和 count limits 在两种策略下仍作为 upper bounds。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-02",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误；WorkQueuePolicy 不允许重叠消费者。文档称在该模式下不能定义 overlapping consumers，每个被 stream 捕获的 subject 一次只能有一个 consumer。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-03",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "InterestPolicy 的消息会在 stream 上所有相关 consumers（过滤时匹配该消息 subject）都收到显式 ACK 后被移除。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-04",
